From f77a4b07d639af457f41186e9122a4a3c22e4992 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patch <p@p>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 06:16:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: export Zabbix LDAP/SAML auth config to GitLab as YAML

Add authentication & user directory (LDAP/SAML JIT provisioning/mapping)
export alongside templates. Two YAML files in auth/:
  - auth/authentication.yaml  (authentication.get, resourcetype 42)
  - auth/userdirectories.yaml (userdirectory.get, resourcetype 49)

Provision mappings keep raw IDs plus resolved names. Quiet-period rule
applied per file via its audit-log resourcetype. New standalone DAG
zabbix_auth_to_gitlab_<env> (@daily) and CLI flags --auth/--auth-subdir.
PyYAML-only; PDF deferred. Verified for Zabbix 7.4.5 and Airflow 3.1.2.
